\item every unit's row at \code{t0} is \code{treatment == "observed"};
\item the unit shares at \code{t0} sum to 1 within \code{identity_rel};
\item where the anchor rows carry \code{value}, each share equals that value's
share of the anchor-year total within \code{identity_rel} (\code{basis = "value"}; \code{"share_only"} where any anchor value is missing, as it is
for a residual pseudo-unit, and then only the checks above bite);
\item \code{t0} is the \code{"start"} seam \code{seams} names for that series.
